LICENSES

This repository bundles several third-party components, each under its own
license. See docs/attribution.md for links and credits, and components/
VENDORED.md for the exact upstream versions of the vendored Adafruit
libraries.

Project code
------------
* Project source (main/, docs/): Apache-2.0
* Template code this project was built from: Apache-2.0

Bundled components
------------------
* bluepad32:               Apache-2.0
* bluepad32_arduino:       Apache-2.0 and LGPL-2.1-or-later
* btstack:                 See https://github.com/bluekitchen/btstack/blob/master/LICENSE
                           NOTE: BTstack is free for non-commercial use.
                           Commercial use requires a license from BlueKitchen
                           GmbH.
* arduino-esp32:           LGPL-2.1-or-later (git submodule, components/arduino)

Vendored Adafruit libraries
---------------------------
* Adafruit_BusIO:          MIT           (components/Adafruit_BusIO/LICENSE)
* Adafruit_NeoPixel:       LGPL-3.0      (components/Adafruit_NeoPixel/COPYING)
* Adafruit_PWMServoDriver: BSD-3-Clause  (components/Adafruit_PWMServoDriver/license.txt)

Copyleft obligations
--------------------
Adafruit_NeoPixel (LGPL-3.0), arduino-esp32 and bluepad32_arduino
(LGPL-2.1-or-later) are statically linked into the firmware image. The
corresponding source for all of them is present in this repository and
unmodified, which satisfies the relinking requirement. If you modify any of
that source, your changes must remain published under the same license.
